{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultSize"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"size"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4SizeV","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Size","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Size"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","text":"Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The default size for new windows created from a scene.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"size"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A scene that uses a default size for new windows.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this scene modifier to indicate a default initial size for a new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"window that the system creates from a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" declaration. For"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"example, you can request that new windows that a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"generates occupy 600 points in the x-dimension and 400 points in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the y-dimension:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@main","struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            ContentView()","        }","        .defaultSize(CGSize(width: 600, height: 400))","    }","}"],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The size that you specify acts only as a default for when the window"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first appears. People can later resize the window using interface"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"controls that the system provides. Also, during state restoration,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the system restores windows to their most recent size rather than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the default size."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you specify a default size that’s outside the range of the window’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"inherent resizability in one or both dimensions, the system clamps the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"affected dimension to keep it in range. You can configure the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"resizability of a scene using the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene\/windowResizability(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"modifier.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The default size modifier affects any scene type that creates windows","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in macOS, namely:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Window"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DocumentGroup"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Settings"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you want to specify the input directly in terms of width and height,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Scene\/defaultSize(width:height:)"},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Swift\/Never\/defaultSize(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets a default size for a window."}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultSize"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Size","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4SizeV"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP"}],"extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE11defaultSizeyQrAA0F0VF::SYNTHESIZED::s:s5NeverO","title":"defaultSize(_:)","symbolKind":"method"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Swift","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Swift\/Never"]]},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/swift\/never\/defaultsize(_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Swift":{"title":"Swift","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/swift","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentati